hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"42","[AI-translation] Mera Azeem Rab pak hai. [Ruku mein kahe]"
"43","[AI-translation] Ae Allah, ae hamare Rab, Tu pak hai; teri hi tareef hai; ae Allah, mujhe bakhsh de. [Ruku aur sajde mein kahe]"
"44","[AI-translation] Bahut pak, bahut muqaddas; farishton aur Ruh [Jibrail] ka Rab. [Ruku aur sajde mein kahe]"
"45","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tere liye ruku kiya, Tujh par iman laya, tere supurd hua; tere samne jhuke meri samaat, basarat, maghz, haddi, nas aur mere qadam jo uthate hain—Allah Rabbul-aalamin ke liye. [Ruku mein kahe]"
"46","[AI-translation] Jabarut, malkut, kibriya aur azmat wale [Allah] ki paki. [Ruku aur sajde mein kahe]"
